# Settings > About radio, installing what the check found.
#
# The half of this screen no picture could reach any other way: every state below needs a radio
# in a bootloader, half a megabyte on the way down, or a loader advertising on the air. What is
# worth looking at is that it reads as one ladder from both buses - "writing" is blocks to a
# drive over a cable and chunks to a characteristic over the air, and a row answering "where has
# this got to" should not have to care which.
scene demo
clock 2026-09-09 14:20
delay 1800
config

tab settings
key down 1
key a

# The press, on a radio attached by cable. The row above it is the check's answer and the row
# below is what to do about it, which is the pair this whole section is built around.
firmware-install idle usb
hold 2000

# The question in front of it, which is not optional and is not "OK/Cancel": over USB the worst
# case is a board sitting in its bootloader that any computer can write again, so the sheet says
# that rather than a warning borrowed from the other bus.
key a
hold 2600
key b
hold 900

# The same row on a radio connected over Bluetooth, and the sheet that belongs to it. This is the
# one that has to be read: the radio leaves the mesh for a loader there is no way back out of
# except finishing.
firmware-install idle ble
key a
hold 3000
key b
hold 900

# The ladder. The two steps with a fraction fill the meter; the ones without draw an
# indeterminate bar rather than a bar stuck at nothing, because forty seconds of waiting for a
# bootloader at 0% reads as a job that stalled.
firmware-install resolving ble
hold 1400
firmware-install downloading ble 62
hold 1800
firmware-install ready ble
hold 1400
firmware-install arming ble
hold 1400
firmware-install waiting ble
hold 1400
firmware-install writing ble 43
hold 1800
firmware-install restarting ble
hold 1400
firmware-install done ble
hold 1800

# And the failure that leaves a radio somewhere it cannot leave on its own. The row carries the
# radio's own words, and the banner is what says the same thing from every other screen - so the
# scene walks off this tab to show it, since About radio is precisely where it stands down.
firmware-install failed ble
hold 2400
tab status
hold 3000
